{"resourceIdentifier":"2619","resourceName":"Tombwe Smallholder Reforestation Project","description":"The Tombwe Reforestation Project is a grouped project working across four key regions of Zambia. The reforestation project builds of Tombwe's multi-decade experience building a network of smallholder farmers. The project utilizes degraded lands and thousands of smallholders to plant select species of clumping bamboo. The project has been operational since 2019, and targets the planting of >950,000 seedlings over a ten year period. These plantings will result in significant and quantifiable carbon emissions removals while also providing a sustainable source of biomass for wood fuel and energy use, thereby reducing pressure on remaining trees and woodland areas.","location":{"latitude":12.832169,"longitude":27.920743},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-12","endExclusive":"2021-11-12","endInclusive":"2021-11-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2619"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Central, Eastern, Western and Southern Zambia"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tombwe Processing Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"Lusaka Province, Zambia"},{"type":"string","value":"+260 762028446"},{"type":"string","value":"stijn@tombwe.co.zm"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"56657"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3302 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","va